1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Most Sudoku ends with the last number.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Orbace keeps what happened before it.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Rewind your solve. Find the move that opened the grid.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Turn a difficult solve into a lesson.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Your solve becomes a record.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Compete when you are ready.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
A calmer way to play. A clearer way to compete.
